From e8114be3f874209eae7193ba90680e25002ac3f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlessandroRCL <alessandro.1901.ramiro@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(monitoring): add water tanks with level, low level
 alert and replenishment prediction (US28-US30)

Tanks belong to a location and can be linked to a device. Each level reading updates
the current level and the available liters (US28); crossing the critical level
publishes TankLevelLowEvent once until the tank is refilled (US29). The detail of the
tank includes the moment of reaching the critical level estimated from the consumption
pattern since the last refill (US30).
